                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Willemstad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-05-24"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24,
                        1906</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell informs Mr. Root that at 3 p.m. yesterday General Castro issued a
                    proclamation to the Venezuelans in which he stated that he had decided to retire
                    absolutely from public eye, and that he would present his resignation at the
                    next session of Congress, in accordance with the statement in said
                    proclamation.)</p>
            </div>
